+def get_favourable_price(p_price, p_symbol, credit):
+    """Snap toward the side of the grid the account would rather be on.
+
+    Money coming in rounds up and money going out rounds down, so the snapped
+    price is never worse for the account than the raw one. Working orders use
+    this; the older single sided callers keep `get_valid_price`.
